# Yuna, Hope of Spira. Turn 1 Bot1 casts Spirit of the Labyrinth (an enchantment creature); Bot2 bolts it on turn 2, so an
# enchantment card is in Bot1's graveyard. Turn 3 Bot1 casts Llanowar Elves (not an enchantment) and Yuna. At the beginning of
# Bot1's end step Yuna returns the Spirit with a finality counter (CR 122.6). In that end step it is Bot1's turn, so Yuna and the
# Spirit have trample, lifelink and ward {2} (the Elves, not an enchantment creature, have none), and Bot2's second Bolt at the
# Spirit, with a single untapped Mox Ruby to pay for it, cannot pay ward {2}: it is countered and the Spirit takes no damage.

